'''Consultant Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Summer Break Cats Paradise (Event Gacha)|Summer Break Cats Paradise Event Gacha]]. He was added in [[Version 14.6 Update|Version 14.6]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 822
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Consultant Cat
|name2 = Business Partner Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Business Partner Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
A decently spammable [[:Category:Anti-Metal Cats|anti-Metal]] DPS and crowd controller, boasting the [[Metal Killer]] ability, this time taking 10% of a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy's current HP every hit. His attack rate and standing range lets him comfortably outrange and reliably damage almost every relevant Metal enemy in the game, from [[Metal Cyclone]] to [[Sir Metal Seal]].

There are a few things to note, however: his [[Single Attack]] causes him to struggle immensely in mixed (or just generally spammy) stages; while he does outrange most Metals, his standing range is not very high, and his HP means he cannot tank any amount of damage whatsoever, giving him horrible survivability; [[Money Up]] is almost cosmetic, due to the nature of the Metal Killer ability only ever taking 10% of a target's '''current HP''', he will typically not be landing the final blow unless deliberately set up. Regardless, he remains a valuable asset for {{4c}} stages, but should never be your main source of Metal DPS in a stage.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

